    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Nov 2024 08:35:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期聊聊我们更喜欢的釜山，见山见海的咖啡厅美得超出预期，章鱼虾仁锅，猪肉汤饭超级好吃且国内无同款，除了略有些语言障碍，总体完美的一个旅游城市～</span><br><span>另外穿插补充了一些去韩国旅行的注意事项，地图，打车，语言，换钱。有些坑还真是不踩不知道。</span><br><span> </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="69">01:09</a> 青瓦台与景福宫</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 釜山行与《釜山行》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="686">11:26</a> 海云台的美食街</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 蓝色胶囊小火车</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1324">22:04</a> 白浅滩文化村与最美咖啡厅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2058">34:18</a> 汉江公园与《汉江怪物》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a> 逛仁川机场</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>青瓦台</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtFKL3AlKTKiLJYTHyDRlcWiP4yz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>最美咖啡厅</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lo7KFimgx97Yjfi15fYDd9QKQSuo.jpeg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fus2z2OiPOAKEqYJ5jY1DbBZ6Vk7.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liu7lBKAwxhNUFYFNLkUxhAL-Vv1.m4a" length="67545725" type="audio/mp4"/>
