  <item>
    <title>E29 走访匪夷所思的梨泰院，韩国首尔行</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671f41f0d6a26a393ca16e50</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671f41f0d6a26a393ca16e50</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 07:59:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上个月去韩国旅行了，九天八夜的深度游，击败 95% 以上赴韩游客的单次旅行时长～ 😏</span><br><span>看秀看景吃美食，走访电影拍摄地，还时隔十多年重见了当年的韩国朋友，整体很充实，也充分感受到旅行度假的魅力所在。</span><br><span>本期我们就先来聊聊在首尔的旅行经历 ～</span><br><span> </span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 入境韩国：差点“被海关遣返”</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 明洞夜市与满大街的韩国便利店</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 值得一看的拌饭秀</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 梨泰院：大型踩踏事故到底是怎么发生的</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1532">25:32</a> 探访《请回答1988》拍摄场景</span><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1624">27:04</a> 跟本地人聊韩国社会：日韩差异，教育内卷</span><br><span> </span><br><span> </span><strong><span>梨泰院发生踩踏事故的巷子</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr00Hg7u_UBAVgdLj2IGmeJbcQNa.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/li6Oihlzd6I-zBopnXTLXVfNdIGd.m4a" length="58522329" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:40:19</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkNvEPgWlPMbZMB0K2cjjwAcmjig.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
