    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65cd7cda35dd8780edccca11</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cd7cda35dd8780edccca11</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Feb 2024 02:54:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2024 新春快乐～ 书接上期，本期节目聊聊小杨同学地中海邮轮行的沿途观感以及一些欧洲旅行的 Tips。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">01:28</a> 沿途风情：马略卡，巴塞罗那，拉西佩齐亚，那不勒斯</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="580">09:40</a> 邮轮 Tips：旅行准备，订票技巧，逃生演习</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> 杂谈海上灾难片与克苏鲁神话</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1360">22:40</a> 其他邮轮行：多瑙河河轮，国内邮轮</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> 今年的旅行规划：大加纳利群岛</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小杨同学供图</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlqTYrPriI5ohdH_hGmmAAHX0kIj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqQzINLjWUl4idNewfTDSmBmY3oy.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpz5L6x6Y7V8lLBBsfzYwA2Blng1.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_6HeWWtOdgz8nBZYPtf5AE16Gj.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgs4mjBAyPwTixgJQw-Sm_KLLY-T.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
