  <item>
    <title>E22 滞后的支付大战，跟桂哥聊聊日本的支付行业</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658a34bebf3589e894408242</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658a34bebf3589e894408242</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Dec 2023 02:04:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天有幸请到微软 10 届MVP， 在日本聚合支付一线深耕多年的桂哥一起来闲聊日本的支付行业以及技术。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="108">1:48</a> 从国内社区到日本支付服务开发一线</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="192">3:12</a> 滞后的日本支付行业？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="563">9:23</a> 信用卡支付 vs QR成长性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="689">11:29</a> QR支付趋势渐成</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1006">16:46</a> 地方政府的QR支付助力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 聚合支付的技术栈以及高可用性的需求</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 稳中求细, 不怕慢的的日式开发</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2165">36:05</a> 不用卷的日本支付IT</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关资料：</span><br><span> </span><a href="https://dotnetconf.cn/#conference-speakers" data-url="https://dotnetconf.cn/#conference-speakers"><span>桂哥 &nbsp;- 开发者，架构师，微软10届MVP</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.nira.or.jp/paper/report212309_pre.pdf" data-url="https://www.nira.or.jp/paper/report212309_pre.pdf"><span>2023非现金支付实态调查</span></a></p>]]></description>
